        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.912109375,
        161.72140502929688,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        102.02508544921875,
        513.4605102539062,
        115.3765869140625
      ],
      "text": "Endorsed. No change to recommendation except to include children specifically in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        118.0216064453125,
        174.9233856201172,
        131.37310791015625
      ],
      "text": "recommendation:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        145.046630859375,
        210.389404296875,
        158.67413330078125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 7: n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        169.85211181640625,
        513.4716796875,
        183.4796142578125
      ],
      "text": "Routine HIV testing should be offered to all patients, including children,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        183.652099609375,
        298.21490478515625,
        197.27960205078125
      ],
      "text": "with presumptive and diagnosed TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        203.7310791015625,
        351.0343933105469,
        217.08258056640625
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        232.1511993408203,
        202.13540649414062,
        249.0072021484375
      ],
      "text": "Scoring systems",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        256.75469970703125,
        230.95140075683594,
        270.3822021484375
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        275.86767578125,
        513.4606323242188,
        289.21917724609375
      ],
      "text": "WHO has not previously made a recommendation in relation to the use of diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        291.86419677734375,
        513.46044921875,
        305.2156982421875
      ],
      "text": "scoring systems, nor has the Organization ever produced a scoring system, although",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        307.8607177734375,
        462.02093505859375,
        321.21221923828125
      ],
      "text": "scoring systems used in some countries have been falsely attributed to WHO.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        332.09320068359375,
        165.53939819335938,
        345.720703125
      ],
      "text": "Considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        351.2062072753906,
        513.4375,
        364.5577087402344
      ],
      "text": "The limitations and lack of validation of scoring systems are well recognized. A recent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        367.20269775390625,
        513.3914794921875,
        380.55419921875
      ],
      "text": "evaluation of a range of scoring systems found performance to be highly variable and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        383.1991882324219,
        146.38038635253906,
        396.5506896972656
      ],
      "text": "poor overall.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        407.7056884765625,
        513.4490356445312,
        421.05718994140625
      ],
      "text": "The Panel therefore considered whether a “negative” recommendation should be made",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        423.7021789550781,
        513.4949951171875,
        437.0536804199219
      ],
      "text": "against the use of scoring systems for clinical diagnosis of TB in children. After discussion,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        439.69866943359375,
        396.24090576171875,
        453.0501708984375
      ],
      "text": "however, the Panel decided not to make any recommendation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        463.9291687011719,
        161.72140502929688,
        477.5566711425781
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        483.04217529296875,
        188.98788452148438,
        496.3936767578125
      ],
      "text": "No recommendation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        507.2744140625,
        295.07550048828125,
        520.9019165039062
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of TB in children (Chapter 4)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        526.3873901367188,
        513.4030151367188,
        539.7388916015625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for the treatment of TB in children have been reviewed and revised",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        542.31494140625,
        513.4605102539062,
        555.7354125976562
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on the  since the 2006 publication of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        558.3114624023438,
        513.4029541015625,
        571.73193359375
      ],
      "text": "management of childhood tuberculosis.  Specifically, dosage recommendations were",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        574.3768920898438,
        513.4606323242188,
        587.7283935546875
      ],
      "text": "revised because it was recognized that young children require higher dosages than",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        590.3734130859375,
        513.4490356445312,
        603.7249145507812
      ],
      "text": "older children and adults to achieve the same target serum level of drug, adequate for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        606.3699340820312,
        164.45840454101562,
        619.721435546875
      ],
      "text": "optimal activity.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        630.8764038085938,
        513.4835815429688,
        644.2279052734375
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations that relate to these revisions of treatment of TB in children are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        646.8729248046875,
        513.4146118164062,
        660.2244262695312
      ],
      "text": "included in: Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children. Geneva, World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        662.8694458007812,
        306.81695556640625,
        676.220947265625
      ],
      "text": "Organization, 2010 (WHO/HTM/TB/2010.13).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        693.8173217773438,
        360.2933654785156,
        710.67333984375
      ],
      "text": "The recommended range for isoniazid",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        718.4208374023438,
        230.95140075683594,
        732.04833984375
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        737.46484375,
        513.4375610351562,
        750.8853149414062
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children.  Geneva, World Health Organization,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        753.5303344726562,
        233.97589111328125,
        766.8818359375
      ],
      "text": "2010 (WHO/HTM/TB/2010.13)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
